    <header/>
    <body>
      <trans-unit id="simplecmp.parent"><source>SimpleCMP</source><target>SimpleCMP</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="mlang_tabs_tab"><source>SimpleCMP banner design</source><target>SimpleCMP-Banner-Design</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="mlang_labels_tablabel"><source>Customise the consent banner</source><target>Einwilligungs-Banner anpassen</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="mlang_labels_tabdescr"><source>Configure the colors, typography, and corner radius of the SimpleCMP consent banner per Site Set. Changes apply to the next frontend page render.</source><target>Farben, Typografie und Eckenradius des SimpleCMP-Einwilligungs-Banners pro Site Set konfigurieren. Änderungen werden mit dem nächsten Frontend-Aufruf wirksam.</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.title"><source>Banner design</source><target>Banner-Design</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.intro"><source>Customise how the SimpleCMP consent banner looks on your site. Each Site Set has its own theme; changes take effect on the next frontend page render.</source><target>Passe das Aussehen des SimpleCMP-Einwilligungs-Banners auf deiner Website an. Jedes Site Set hat sein eigenes Design; Änderungen werden mit dem nächsten Frontend-Aufruf wirksam.</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.sitePicker.label"><source>Site</source><target>Site</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.sitePicker.customBadge"><source>Custom theme active</source><target>Eigenes Design aktiv</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.languagePicker.label"><source>Preview language</source><target>Vorschau-Sprache</target></trans-unit>

      <!-- Policy URLs status block -->
      <trans-unit id="designer.policyUrls.heading"><source>Privacy policy &amp; imprint URLs (read-only here)</source><target>Datenschutzerklärung &amp; Impressum-URLs (hier nur Anzeige)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.policyUrls.privacy"><source>Privacy policy</source><target>Datenschutzerklärung</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.policyUrls.imprint"><source>Imprint (Impressum)</source><target>Impressum</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.policyUrls.unset"><source>not configured</source><target>nicht konfiguriert</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.policyUrls.editAction"><source>Edit in Site settings</source><target>In Site-Einstellungen bearbeiten</target></trans-unit>

      <!-- Empty-state -->
      <trans-unit id="designer.emptyState.title"><source>No site uses SimpleCMP yet</source><target>Noch keine Site nutzt SimpleCMP</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.emptyState.message"><source>Banner design can only be configured for sites whose configuration includes the &quot;%s&quot; Site Set. None of your sites does at the moment, so the FE bundle never loads and there is nothing to theme here.</source><target>Banner-Design kann nur für Sites konfiguriert werden, deren Konfiguration das Site-Set „%s“ enthält. Aktuell tut das keine deiner Sites — das Frontend-Bundle wird nirgends geladen und es gibt hier nichts zu gestalten.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.emptyState.knownSites"><source>Sites detected in this installation:</source><target>In dieser Installation gefundene Sites:</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.emptyState.howTo"><source>Add the SimpleCMP set to one of the configs above by appending these lines to the `dependencies:` block, then reload this module:</source><target>Füge das SimpleCMP-Set zu einer der obigen Configs hinzu, indem du diese Zeilen unter den `dependencies:`-Block hängst, und lade das Modul neu:</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.group.brand"><source>Brand colors</source><target>Markenfarben</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.group.surface"><source>Text &amp; background</source><target>Text &amp; Hintergrund</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.group.advanced"><source>Advanced colors</source><target>Erweiterte Farben</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.group.typography"><source>Typography</source><target>Typografie</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.group.shape"><source>Shape</source><target>Form</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.group.placement"><source>Banner placement</source><target>Banner-Position</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.group.overrides"><source>Override banner texts</source><target>Banner-Texte überschreiben</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.intro"><source>Override individual bundle strings for one language at a time. Use this to choose formal vs. informal tone (Du/Sie etc.) or to fully rewrite a button label. Leave a field empty to fall back to the bundle's default.</source><target>Überschreibe einzelne Bundle-Strings — pro Sprache. Damit kannst du den Tonfall wählen (Du/Sie) oder einen Button-Text komplett neu setzen. Lass ein Feld leer, um den Bundle-Default zu verwenden.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.scopeLabel"><source>Editing language</source><target>Sprache, die du gerade bearbeitest</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.placeholder"><source>(uses bundle default)</source><target>(nutzt Bundle-Default)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.activeBadge"><source>override active</source><target>Override aktiv</target></trans-unit>
      <!-- Per-key Klartext-Labels -->
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.consentNotice.title"><source>Banner heading</source><target>Banner-Überschrift</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.consentNotice.description"><source>Banner description (main text)</source><target>Banner-Text (Haupttext)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.consentNotice.changeDescription"><source>Banner description on return visit (after consent changed)</source><target>Banner-Text bei wiederholtem Besuch (nach Änderung)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.consentNotice.learnMore"><source>"Configure" button label</source><target>„Konfigurieren"-Button-Text</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.consentNotice.testing"><source>"Testing mode" notice</source><target>„Testmodus"-Hinweis</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.consentModal.title"><source>Modal heading (settings dialog)</source><target>Modal-Überschrift (Einstellungsdialog)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.consentModal.description"><source>Modal description (above the service list)</source><target>Modal-Text (über der Dienste-Liste)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.privacyPolicy.name"><source>Privacy-policy link text</source><target>Link-Text der Datenschutzerklärung</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.imprint.name"><source>Imprint link text (standalone footer)</source><target>Impressum-Link-Text (separater Footer)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.consentNotice.imprint.name"><source>Imprint link text (next to privacy policy)</source><target>Impressum-Link-Text (neben Datenschutzerklärung)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.acceptAll"><source>"Accept all" button label</source><target>„Alle akzeptieren"-Button-Text</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.acceptSelected"><source>"Accept selected" button label</source><target>„Auswahl akzeptieren"-Button-Text</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.decline"><source>"Decline" button label</source><target>„Ablehnen"-Button-Text</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.save"><source>"Save" button label</source><target>„Speichern"-Button-Text</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.overrides.label.ok"><source>"OK" button label (banner accept)</source><target>„OK"-Button-Text (Banner-Annahme)</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-primary"><source>Primary color (Accept button background)</source><target>Primärfarbe (Hintergrund des Akzeptieren-Buttons)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-primary-hover"><source>Primary hover (Accept button hover state)</source><target>Primärfarbe Hover (Hover-Zustand des Akzeptieren-Buttons)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-text"><source>Body text</source><target>Fließtext</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-text-muted"><source>Muted text (descriptions, hints)</source><target>Dezenter Text (Beschreibungen, Hinweise)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-bg"><source>Card background</source><target>Kartenhintergrund</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-bg-alt"><source>Alternate background (badges, required-pill)</source><target>Alternativhintergrund (Badges, Pflicht-Marker)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-border"><source>Border</source><target>Rahmen</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-danger"><source>Decline color</source><target>Ablehnen-Farbe</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.font-family"><source>Body font family (CSS font-family stack)</source><target>Fließtext-Schriftfamilie (CSS-font-family-Stack)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.font-family-heading"><source>Heading font family</source><target>Überschrift-Schriftfamilie</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.font-size"><source>Body font size (px or rem)</source><target>Fließtext-Schriftgröße (px oder rem)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.font-size-heading"><source>Heading font size (px or rem)</source><target>Überschrift-Schriftgröße (px oder rem)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.radius"><source>Corner radius (e.g. 6px)</source><target>Eckenradius (z. B. 6px)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.position"><source>Where the banner sits on screen</source><target>Wo der Banner auf dem Bildschirm steht</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.action.detectFonts"><source>Detect fonts from active site</source><target>Schriften der aktiven Site erkennen</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.preview.title"><source>Live preview</source><target>Live-Vorschau</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.preview.help"><source>The consent banner updates as you edit. Click Configure inside the banner to see the modal with all services.</source><target>Das Einwilligungs-Banner aktualisiert sich beim Bearbeiten. „Konfigurieren" im Banner anklicken, um den Dialog mit allen Diensten zu sehen.</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.action.save"><source>Save theme</source><target>Design speichern</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.action.reset"><source>Reset to defaults</source><target>Auf Standard zurücksetzen</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.action.reset.confirm"><source>Discard this site's custom theme and revert to the SimpleCMP defaults?</source><target>Eigenes Design dieser Site verwerfen und auf SimpleCMP-Standards zurücksetzen?</target></trans-unit>
    </body>
